	<section_number>19.2-215</section_number>
	<catch_line>Costs of special grand jury</catch_line>
	<text>
		All costs incurred for services provided by the court for a special grand jury shall be paid by the Commonwealth.
	</text>
	<history>1975, c. 495.</history>
